      "widgets_values": [
        "r34l1sm Realistic live-action cinematic look, action movie trailer, practical film photography, anamorphic lens, shallow depth of field, film grain.\nAt 0.00 seconds the woman from the first frame is fully referenced: same face, same long blonde hair, same burgundy sleeveless top, adult woman.\nShe is in a Hong Kong night market in light rain. She is not fighting; she is the lead, moving through the scene with athletic urgency while two stunt performers trade practical kung-fu behind her.\nStoryboard:\n[0-1.2s] close: her face from the first frame turns, rain on hair, she looks off-camera then starts moving.\n[1.2-2.8s] mid: she weaves between hanging roast ducks and steam, the two fighters clash in the background.\n[2.8-4.2s] handheld: she ducks a swinging wok, hair wet, identity locked.\n[4.2-5s] freeze on her grin after a roll, same face.\nHands stay attached, one complete body, no extra limbs. Audio: rain, market chatter, wok sizzle, body impacts. No text, logos, cartoon. Adults only.",
        1344,
        768,
        124
      ]
    },
