      "widgets_values": [
        "## B70 FL2VA I2V (face first-frame)\n\nWinning turbo-8 cinema recipe + first frame.\n\n- UNet: `minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_fp8_scaled`\n- 1344x768, 124 frames / 5s, 24fps\n- people LoRA 1.0 + turbo-8 0.75\n- sampler `er_sde`, 8 steps, simple, shift 12/3\n- CLIP on **cpu** (required on 32GB XPU)\n- first frame: `sergio-face-i2v-1344x768.jpg`\n- Official 20-step `res_multistep` is slower and looked worse than this turbo-8 path on B70 T2V.\n- Face still is from `input/face-reference/portraits`.\n- SageAttention is CUDA-only; this host uses pytorch SDPA."
      ],
      "title": "B70 notes"
    }
